      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This kavvanah was written in preparation for a class I taught for the Green Sabbath Project, “Follow the Goat: using the scapegoat ritual in creating new kavvanot / sacred intentions for lighting Shabbat candles.”</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_56631_introduction"/>
